    "What is said shows here once the agent records it. If its terminal has a conversation that never shows here, its record can't be found (start Codex with --no-daemon).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说过的话会在 agent 写进会话记录后出现在这里。如果终端里已有对话，这里却一直没有，说明读不到它的会话记录（Codex 要用 --no-daemon 启动）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working": {
      "localizations": {
